{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.650 and F1 of 0.628, which exceeds previous RNA-only baselines. The results suggest multiprofile settings and aggregation may improve performance, but their individual contributions remain uncertain without direct comparison to alternative aggregation strategies or profile configurations. The role of image modality and fusion remains unexplored in this RNA-only setup."
}

